WEBVTT

00:14.990 --> 00:16.160
<i>My name is...</i>

00:31.820 --> 00:34.060
Tomokui Kanata!

00:34.060 --> 00:37.960
<i>Y'know, my name doesn't 
actually matter right now.</i>

00:37.960 --> 00:41.690
<i>What does is the fact that on
 that day, in that moment....</i>

00:43.520 --> 00:45.630
<i>I definitely died.</i>

02:21.500 --> 02:24.000
<b>Day 1</b>

02:28.490 --> 02:32.690
Oh-ho. Eyes open already?

02:32.690 --> 02:35.510
<i>What is this? How am I alive?</i>

02:35.510 --> 02:39.030
<i>And who is this filthy green monster?</i>

02:39.530 --> 02:44.430
Let's see... I think I'll call 
this big one Gobkichi,

02:44.430 --> 02:47.420
and you'll be... Gobrou!

02:47.420 --> 02:49.840
Gobrou should be fine.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.740
<i>Couldn't muster a little extra effort?</i>

02:51.740 --> 02:53.400
Here, now.

02:54.610 --> 02:58.150
<i>No good... Too sleepy...</i>

02:59.030 --> 03:01.540
<b>Day 2</b>

03:02.710 --> 03:08.350
<i>When I woke up the next day, I was
surrounded by a bunch of ugly green babies.</i>

03:10.130 --> 03:14.800
<i>And it seemed I was one, too.</i>

03:15.600 --> 03:17.960
<i>Which is what finally convinced me.</i>

03:17.960 --> 03:22.760
<i>I had died, and then been 
reborn as this green...</i>

03:22.760 --> 03:27.190
<i>Completely helpless little goblin.</i>

03:30.290 --> 03:33.190
<i>You can see why I'd cry, right?</i>

03:33.690 --> 03:36.200
<b>Day 3</b>

03:36.950 --> 03:40.450
<i>It seems goblins mature 
way faster than I expected.</i>

03:41.130 --> 03:44.270
<i>After a good night's sleep, 
my body had grown a lot bigger.</i>

03:46.620 --> 03:47.710
Okay.

03:50.350 --> 03:56.460
<i>Wherever this is, and whatever I am now, 
I've got a second chance at life.</i>

03:57.020 --> 03:59.970
<i>This time, I'm gonna survive as best I can!</i>

04:00.470 --> 04:02.970
<b>Day 4</b>

04:04.970 --> 04:09.300
This will be the last food you get from me.

04:09.300 --> 04:13.980
From now on you'll have to 
get your own food. Got it?

04:47.620 --> 04:51.900
<i>One sun and a blue sky, but
it's filled with creepy birds...</i>

04:55.120 --> 04:57.280
<i>And there are plants I don't recognize.</i>

04:57.280 --> 05:01.840
<i>This really is a different world 
from the one I know.</i>

05:01.840 --> 05:04.660
Never seen the outside before.

05:04.660 --> 05:07.040
I haven't either, Gobkichi.

05:07.610 --> 05:09.540
Gob...kichi?

05:09.870 --> 05:11.690
That's your name, right?

05:11.690 --> 05:13.040
Mine's Gobrou.

05:13.380 --> 05:14.620
Gobrou?

05:14.620 --> 05:16.800
Yep. It's Gobrou.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.910
<i>For the last three days, anyway.</i>

05:19.600 --> 05:26.810
<i>I teamed up with Gobkichi, the biggest 
of the goblin kids, for one reason...</i>

05:29.810 --> 05:31.080
<i>To hunt.</i>

05:36.330 --> 05:38.070
Nice, Gobkichi!

05:43.340 --> 05:46.210
One chases, the other catches.

05:46.210 --> 05:47.950
Hunting's best with two...

05:49.300 --> 05:50.370
Hey!

05:51.350 --> 05:53.740
What are you doing, trying 
to eat it without me?!

05:53.740 --> 05:56.590
We're supposed to share! Got it?!

05:59.290 --> 06:03.000
<i>After demonstrating the nature 
of our relationship to Gobkichi,</i>

06:03.000 --> 06:07.220
<i>I was examining the horn rabbit to see if
 I could make a weapon from its horn, when...</i>

06:08.970 --> 06:11.980
<b>Gobrou obtained [(Small) Creature's Horn]</b>

06:11.980 --> 06:13.980
What was that just now?

06:18.250 --> 06:20.980
Yeah, fine, I get it.

06:23.990 --> 06:26.770
Thanks, Gobrou!

06:26.770 --> 06:29.740
Either eat or cry. Pick one.

06:30.240 --> 06:32.750
<b>Day 5</b>

06:40.930 --> 06:43.890
This horn is legendarily good!

06:46.490 --> 06:47.760
There...

06:48.010 --> 06:51.520
<b>Gobrou obtained [(Medium) Creature's Horn]</b>

06:51.990 --> 06:53.330
There it goes again.

06:53.330 --> 06:54.260
What does?

06:54.260 --> 06:57.020
It's nothing. Come on. Let's eat.

07:04.150 --> 07:07.570
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Escape]</b>

07:05.110 --> 07:06.420
<i>Escape.</i>

07:08.340 --> 07:10.580
Well, that explains it...

07:15.080 --> 07:21.630
<i>Absorption. That's the extremely rare ESP 
ability I was born with, back in my old world.</i>

07:22.630 --> 07:28.360
<i>To put it simply, I can eat just 
about anything: iron, gold, poison...</i>

07:28.360 --> 07:34.370
<i>And I have a chance of gaining 
the traits of whatever I eat.</i>

07:35.700 --> 07:41.690
<i>Sadly, it seems like any other abilities 
I had in my past life have been reset...</i>

07:44.220 --> 07:46.300
Wow, Gobrou.

07:46.700 --> 07:50.630
<i>But having this one seems 
to have been plenty lucky as it is.</i>

07:50.630 --> 07:52.650
You should try it this way, Gobkichi.

07:51.650 --> 07:53.330
<i>Because in this world...</i>

07:54.080 --> 07:59.580
<i>There are plenty of monsters lurking 
with incredible powers.</i>

08:00.080 --> 08:02.590
<b>Day 6</b>

08:04.590 --> 08:07.760
You two are eating horn rabbits?!

08:07.760 --> 08:09.220
That's amazing!

08:09.220 --> 08:12.850
Is it? Uh...

08:13.200 --> 08:14.390
I'm Gobmi!

08:14.390 --> 08:19.530
And yeah, someone died the other day 
after being gored by a horn rabbit!

08:20.390 --> 08:23.590
You're Gobrou, right? 
You really are amazing!

08:23.590 --> 08:26.860
You're so smart, and cool, 
and strong on top of that!

08:27.500 --> 08:29.490
Y-You think so?

08:29.890 --> 08:30.850
What about me?

08:30.850 --> 08:31.920
You're ordinary!

08:33.360 --> 08:34.240
<i>Good for you.</i>

08:34.640 --> 08:36.250
How about this, Gobmi...

08:36.250 --> 08:38.980
You wanna come with us on tomorrow's hunt?

08:40.670 --> 08:41.810
I do!

08:43.240 --> 08:45.750
<b>Day 7</b>

08:46.180 --> 08:48.760
<i>Sadly, it ended up raining.</i>

08:49.460 --> 08:52.260
<i>We postponed our hunt with
 Gobmi until tomorrow.</i>

08:52.600 --> 08:56.310
<i>For today, I'm going to check 
what we have in storage,</i>

08:56.310 --> 08:58.770
<i>and see whether I can make a new weapon.</i>

09:10.960 --> 09:14.160
<i>When I went into storage to find 
things to make weapons from,</i>

09:14.160 --> 09:17.220
<i>I found a group of captive, human women.</i>

09:18.080 --> 09:23.010
<i>It's pretty obvious why... 
not that I want to think about it.</i>

09:27.100 --> 09:29.740
You seem motivated.

09:30.170 --> 09:32.240
<i>This old-timer is Gobjii.</i>

09:32.240 --> 09:37.460
<i>He held me up right after I had reincarnated 
and gave me the low-effort name of Gobrou.</i>

09:37.460 --> 09:39.430
<i>He's the elder of this cave.</i>

09:39.960 --> 09:45.560
You may level up faster than expected.

09:45.560 --> 09:46.800
Levels?

09:46.800 --> 09:50.070
If you go like this, can you see it?

09:53.070 --> 09:56.580
<b>Gobjii: Lv 86.</b>

09:53.880 --> 09:55.960
<i>Level 86.</i>

09:56.580 --> 10:02.580
If you reach level 100, you'll be able to 
evolve into a more advanced life-form.

10:02.580 --> 10:07.090
You'll be lucky if you're the one goblin 
out of dozens to manage that, though!

10:07.630 --> 10:13.090
<i>Goblins apparently age so quickly that 
this old man is really only in his twenties.</i>

10:13.090 --> 10:16.570
The youngsters from the village 
should be returning soon.

10:16.570 --> 10:21.340
Then you'll get to see what an
 evolved hobgoblin looks like.

10:21.340 --> 10:26.470
I wonder what kind of prey 
they'll bring this time.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.870
<b>Day 8</b>

10:37.270 --> 10:39.080
Nice, Gobmi!

10:43.970 --> 10:45.790
<i>Gobmi as backup.</i>

10:46.390 --> 10:48.290
<i>Me, fighting at middle range.</i>

10:48.310 --> 10:49.060
<i>And...</i>

10:51.260 --> 10:53.010
<i>Gobkichi as our forward.</i>

10:54.060 --> 10:57.510
<i>Our three-goblin formation 
was working like a charm.</i>

11:01.570 --> 11:04.270
Th-This is good! Real good!

11:04.560 --> 11:07.330
I've been eating nothing 
but fruit until now...

11:04.560 --> 11:09.360
*All dishes have been prepared under the supervision of a chef

11:07.330 --> 11:09.350
This is so great!

11:11.070 --> 11:13.150
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Thermography]</b>

11:11.750 --> 11:18.990
<i>Thermography. Venom. 
Venom Resistance. Search. Evil Eye.</i>

11:13.650 --> 11:14.860
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Venom]</b>

11:15.070 --> 11:16.200
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Venom Resistance]</b>

11:16.240 --> 11:17.570
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Search]</b>

11:17.740 --> 11:18.990
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Evil Eye]</b>

11:20.860 --> 11:25.000
Looks like this snake was
 on a whole other level!

11:25.310 --> 11:26.920
What are you talking about?

11:26.920 --> 11:29.310
And can I eat that head?

11:29.310 --> 11:33.730
No, you can't. It's poisonous. 
You guys would die if you ate it.

11:36.410 --> 11:38.760
<i>It doesn't matter how ugly I am.</i>

11:39.980 --> 11:44.590
<i>I'm going to survive in this world... 
in my second life!</i>

11:46.520 --> 11:48.020
<b>Day 9</b>

11:46.870 --> 11:52.020
<i>On my ninth and tenth days, we prepared 
our gear and did the usual hunting.</i>

11:48.020 --> 11:49.520
<b>Day 10</b>

11:49.520 --> 11:52.020
<b>Day 11</b>

11:52.810 --> 11:55.050
<i>And then on the eleventh day,</i>

11:55.050 --> 11:58.780
<i>we made the mistake of doing some 
spelunking, out of curiosity...</i>

12:03.290 --> 12:05.910
What the hell?!

12:06.440 --> 12:07.850
Gobmi, you run on ahead!

12:07.850 --> 12:08.500
Okay!

12:09.090 --> 12:11.080
Gobkichi, get the shield!

12:11.080 --> 12:12.170
Right!

12:16.260 --> 12:17.470
Evil Eye!

12:22.140 --> 12:23.160
Now!

12:28.440 --> 12:30.850
That was awesome, Gobrou!

12:30.850 --> 12:31.740
Yeah.

12:32.540 --> 12:34.150
These taste better than you'd think.

12:34.400 --> 12:36.650
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Echolocation]</b>

12:34.940 --> 12:39.320
<i>Echolocation. Vamp Up. Vamphilia.</i>

12:36.740 --> 12:38.070
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Vamp Up]</b>

12:38.110 --> 12:39.320
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Vamphilia]</b>

12:39.940 --> 12:44.480
<i>And so, I obtained a new set of abilities.</i>

12:49.200 --> 12:50.460
Even the eyes are decent.

12:52.340 --> 12:53.460
Good stuff!

12:53.960 --> 12:56.470
<b>Day 12</b>

13:00.050 --> 13:03.140
<i>It happened late at night.</i>

13:08.650 --> 13:12.370
<i>Having my search ability active 
all the time came in handy.</i>

13:15.820 --> 13:18.930
I couldn't eat another bite...

13:22.360 --> 13:24.410
Six of you, huh?

13:26.750 --> 13:28.150
Hey! What's wrong?

13:28.150 --> 13:29.410
Y-You okay?!

13:31.290 --> 13:36.930
Oh, I was a little rushed, so maybe
 I didn't adjust my Venom correctly.

13:36.930 --> 13:38.140
Sorry about that.

13:40.810 --> 13:43.610
Now, to teach the rest of you a lesson...

13:49.340 --> 13:53.700
Stop! It's okay, Gobmi! 
I'm not hurt or anything!

13:54.190 --> 13:56.700
<b>Day 13</b>

14:09.080 --> 14:10.200
Gobkichi!

14:20.800 --> 14:22.550
I'll take it from here!

14:32.050 --> 14:34.780
<i>I was still worrying about the 
attack from the night before,</i>

14:34.780 --> 14:40.340
<i>when an orc we ran across 
became our first prey of the day.</i>

14:37.960 --> 14:40.340
This is really good!

14:42.280 --> 14:44.570
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Libido]</b>

14:42.890 --> 14:47.200
<i>Libido. Orc Language. Detect Analyze.</i>

14:44.650 --> 14:45.910
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Orc Language]</b>

14:45.990 --> 14:47.200
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Detect Analyze]</b>

14:50.370 --> 14:53.820
Okay, Gobmi, Gobkichi, 
you've had your fill, right?

14:55.900 --> 14:57.580
Let's take the rest back.

15:00.340 --> 15:02.220
Here, eat up.

15:05.850 --> 15:07.280
Are you sure?

15:07.280 --> 15:10.180
Yeah. That's why I brought it.

15:12.350 --> 15:14.160
Th-Thank you.

15:14.160 --> 15:15.510
We appreciate it.

15:24.010 --> 15:29.280
<i>I would've never considered helping out 
the helpless like this in my old world.</i>

15:29.860 --> 15:32.430
<i>Maybe it's not just my appearance.</i>

15:32.430 --> 15:36.870
<i>Maybe something else has changed 
about me since coming here.</i>

15:45.510 --> 15:48.010
<b>Level Values Exceeded</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:49.670
What is this...

15:48.010 --> 15:51.010
<b>Now that the special conditions</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:51.010
<b>[Domination Instinct]</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:51.010
<b>[Unique Movement]</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:51.010
<b>Have been cleared</b>

15:49.670 --> 15:54.380
I'm tired, man. Just let me sleep.

15:51.010 --> 15:54.020
<b>[Evolutionary Advance] into
[Variant: Hobgoblin]</b>

15:54.020 --> 15:59.770
<b>Will you [evolve] now?</b>

15:55.930 --> 15:59.770
<i>I vaguely remember seeing a
 bunch of writing in my head,</i>

16:00.210 --> 16:04.700
<i>so I just swiped yes and went back to sleep.</i>

16:05.900 --> 16:09.780
<b>Gobrou has received
[The Blessing of the Grand God of Demise and Origin]</b>

16:10.410 --> 16:12.910
<b>Day 14</b>

16:22.690 --> 16:24.120
What the...

16:33.110 --> 16:36.850
I look the way I did before reincarnating...

16:39.410 --> 16:41.420
Good morning, Gobkichi.

16:50.570 --> 16:52.080
Gobkichi?

16:53.230 --> 16:56.000
Then this is Gobrou?!

16:57.080 --> 17:02.790
W-Wow! You two are both 
a lot cooler and bigger!

17:04.360 --> 17:09.460
You mean to tell me the two of you 
have ranked up already?!

17:09.460 --> 17:12.550
It hasn't even been a month 
since you were born!

17:13.940 --> 17:15.200
Gobrou...

17:15.200 --> 17:16.310
What's up?

17:17.170 --> 17:21.060
I wanna see how much stronger I am now.

17:21.060 --> 17:23.060
Should we go hunting, then?

17:23.780 --> 17:26.820
Nah. I wanna fight you!

17:49.090 --> 17:50.220
Too slow!

17:55.630 --> 17:58.060
You okay, Gobkichi?

17:59.770 --> 18:02.060
You're so strong, Gobrou.

18:02.060 --> 18:04.910
In terms of just power, 
I'd say you have the edge.

18:04.910 --> 18:05.970
Really?!

18:05.970 --> 18:06.880
Yeah.

18:08.850 --> 18:10.070
What is it?

18:10.450 --> 18:12.470
We've got trouble coming.

18:14.190 --> 18:16.300
Gobmi, you're there, right?

18:16.810 --> 18:18.080
You noticed?

18:18.080 --> 18:21.700
Remember that crossbow 
we made the other day?

18:21.700 --> 18:23.280
Go and grab it!

18:58.620 --> 19:03.620
<i>They're the perfect targets to
 test our evolved strength on.</i>

19:12.480 --> 19:14.190
Let's do this, Gobkichi!

19:14.190 --> 19:15.010
Right!

19:21.270 --> 19:26.390
<i>Using my Venom on Gobmi's 
arrows was the right call.</i>

19:27.510 --> 19:31.190
<i>Without their leader, 
the Black Wolves floundered,</i>

19:31.190 --> 19:35.200
<i>and without their usual teamwork, 
we made quick work of them.</i>

20:01.590 --> 20:03.720
This one must be the leader.

20:10.230 --> 20:12.480
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Wild Hunt]</b>

20:10.870 --> 20:15.150
<i>Wild Hunt. Hide Armor. Order.</i>

20:12.570 --> 20:13.900
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Hide Armor]</b>

20:13.940 --> 20:15.150
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Order]</b>

20:16.300 --> 20:19.160
Military leadership?

20:21.910 --> 20:23.340
No thanks necessary.

20:23.340 --> 20:26.380
But I expect you to catch the same amount 
of prey you've been provided from now on.

20:26.380 --> 20:27.290
Got it?

20:27.290 --> 20:29.050
Catch the same amount?

20:29.050 --> 20:31.290
How're we supposed to do that?

20:31.620 --> 20:34.300
What's wrong? Dissatisfied?

20:35.400 --> 20:36.550
Please, sir!

20:37.060 --> 20:40.300
Please teach us how to kill!

20:41.510 --> 20:42.870
Fine.

20:43.330 --> 20:46.650
If you don't know how to hunt, I'll teach you.

20:46.650 --> 20:49.560
And if you need weapons, 
I'll teach you how to make them!

20:50.030 --> 20:51.600
Thank you so much!

20:51.600 --> 20:52.730
You're a life-saver!

20:52.730 --> 20:54.640
It's fine, get up.

20:55.570 --> 20:58.070
We're all comrades, right?

21:00.070 --> 21:01.780
Gobrou!

21:02.330 --> 21:03.850
Gobrou!

21:03.850 --> 21:13.060
Gobrou! Gobrou! Gobrou!

21:06.330 --> 21:09.170
You're a really good guy!

21:09.170 --> 21:10.670
And a huge help!

21:13.060 --> 21:18.460
<i>I don't know if it's an effect of the Order 
ability I learned, or something else,</i>

21:18.700 --> 21:21.890
<i>but in that moment, it was like 
I could see the path I would take</i>

21:21.890 --> 21:26.640
<i>in that world in right front of me...</i>

21:27.330 --> 21:31.310
<i>I'll eat, and eat, and keep eating, 
keep getting stronger,</i>

21:31.310 --> 21:34.490
<i>lead my comrades, and then...</i>

23:05.450 --> 23:07.950
<b>Day 17</b>

23:07.950 --> 23:11.450
Gob! Gob! Gob!

23:11.800 --> 23:15.960
Four days since training started, 
and they've still got a lot to learn...

23:20.790 --> 23:22.710
Uh...

23:25.320 --> 23:26.920
Gobmi?

23:29.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time:</b>
